==========================================================================
A. EXACT RATIONAL NEWTON RATIOS OF THE BALLOT COLUMNS
==========================================================================
  binom(2k,k)   central              1-R_k = (1) / (k*(2*k + 1))
  Catalan binom(2k,k)/(k+1)          1-R_k = (1) / ((k + 1)*(2*k + 1)/3)
  binom(2k,k-1)   = 1,4,15,56,210    1-R_k = (k**2 - 3*k - 1) / ((k - 1)*(k + 1)**2*(2*k + 1))
  binom(2k+1,k-1) = 1,5,21,84,330    1-R_k = (k**2 - 7*k - 6) / ((k - 1)*(k + 1)*(k + 2)*(2*k + 3))

  numeric check of the closed forms against direct computation:
    Catalan            R = ['4/5', '25/28', '14/15', '21/22']  circuit +++++
    binom(2k,k-1)      R = ['16/15', '225/224', '224/225', '175/176']  circuit ---++
    binom(2k+1,k-1)    R = ['25/21', '21/20', '56/55', '275/273']  circuit -----
    binom(2k,k)        R = ['9/10', '20/21', '35/36', '54/55']  circuit +++++
  VERDICT A: all ratios exactly rational, deg Q <= 2

==========================================================================
B. THE UNIQUE METALLIC DISCRIMINANT IN THE FAMILY IS BRONZE
==========================================================================
    (a,b)=(0,-1): Q = k**2 - 3*k - 1  ->  x^2-3x-1  BRONZE
    (a,b)=(0,1): Q = k**2 - 3*k - 1  ->  x^2-3x-1  BRONZE
    every metallic hit is n=3: True
    bronze root (3+sqrt13)/2 = 3.302775638
    binom(2k,k-1) log-concavity pattern R_k vs 1, k=2..: >><<<<<
    flip occurs between k=3 and k=4, bracketing 3.3028: True
  VERDICT B: BRONZE IS THE UNIQUE METALLIC COLUMN

